            "review_title": "Review at Ecoeats - Vegetarian Bistro And Pub",
            "review_text": "Nhan N\n1 contribution\n0\nA Cozy Green Haven with Great Food & Workspace Vibes\nJul 2025 • Friends\nThe place has this chill, kinda rustic feel with plants hanging everywhere and lots of natural light. Instantly puts you in a good mood.\n\nAs someone who often works from cafés, I appreciate the plush seating and abundance of power outlets. The chairs are ergonomic, the tables spacious, and the Wi-Fi is reliable.\n\nFood-wise, I am highly satisfied with my order: Pestocado pasta, pumpkin soup, and green smoothie. This place is a gem. 5/5 stars!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe cafe is a bit hidden. It's located in the neighborhood near the airport.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 29, 2025",
